---
import GovLayout from '../layouts/GovLayout.astro';
import PhaseBanner from '../components/PhaseBanner.astro';
---
<GovLayout title="Government of ASEAN Motor Club" description="Official government portal for the ASEAN Motor Club — policies, services, and information for all citizens.">

<PhaseBanner tag="GOV" text="Official government portal" />

<main class="govuk-main-wrapper">
  <div class="govuk-grid-column-full">
    <h1>Welcome to ASEAN Motor Club Government</h1>
    <p>Policies, services, and information for all citizens of the ASEAN Motor Club.</p>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-section">Fiscal Policy & Economy</h2>
    <ul class="govuk-topic-list">
      <li>
        <a href="/fiscal-policy">Fiscal Policy: Wealth Tax, Bank Interest & Sovereign Reserves</a>
        <p>Progressive wealth tax, bank interest mechanics, and the Sovereign Reserves framework.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/economy">Economy & Treasury</a>
        <p>Treasury Fund, NIRC schedule, money supply management, and equilibrium multiplier.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-section">Employment & Industry</h2>
    <ul class="govuk-topic-list">
      <li>
        <a href="/employment/jobs">Delivery Jobs</a>
        <p>How jobs are posted, adaptive scaling, completion bonuses, and government funding.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/employment/subsidies">Subsidies</a>
        <p>Cargo subsidies, wrecker subsidies, passenger subsidies, and treasury cap logic.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/employment/supply-chain">Supply Chain Events</a>
        <p>Community-wide delivery challenges with objectives and proportional rewards.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-section">Social Welfare</h2>
    <ul class="govuk-topic-list">
      <li>
        <a href="/welfare/ubi">Universal Basic Income</a>
        <p>UBI rates for active and AFK players, driver level scaling, and loan auto-repayment.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/welfare/gov-employees">Government Employee Programme</a>
        <p>Contribution-based levels, income redirection, salary multiplier, and the GOV tag.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-section">Banking & Credit</h2>
    <ul class="govuk-topic-list">
      <li>
        <a href="/banking/interest">Bank Interest</a>
        <p>Interest rates, online multiplier, balance scaling, and offline decay.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/banking/loans">Loans</a>
        <p>Loan eligibility, fee structure, earnings history cap, and social score modifier.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/banking/credit-score">Credit Score</a>
        <p>0–200 credit scale, evaluation criteria, NPL thresholds, and utilisation penalties.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-section">Justice & Law Enforcement</h2>
    <ul class="govuk-topic-list">
      <li>
        <a href="/justice/money-laundering">Money Laundering & Criminal Faction</a>
        <p>How to join the criminal faction, earn money laundering levels, and evade police.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-section">Reports & Statistics</h2>
    <ul class="govuk-topic-list">
      <li>
        <a href="/reports">All reports and statistical publications</a>
        <p>Official government reports including economic analysis, inequality metrics, and treasury data.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="/reports/economic-activity-q1-2026">Q1 2026 Economic Activity Report</a>
        <p>Quarterly summary of player activity and delivery economics.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</main>

</GovLayout>
